infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Why MTTR stalls: tooling vs culture
  desc Same tools, different MTTR — tooling cuts 10–20%, culture cuts 50–80%
  compares
    - label New tooling alone — 10–20% MTTR cut
      children
        - label Another observability vendor
          desc Shortens each click, never the click count
        - label More dashboards, faster queries
          desc Marginal once you are already in triage
        - label Disabling noisy alerts
          desc Good hygiene, no investigation-time win
        - label Plateaus at 30-min MTTR
          desc Strong tools, weak culture: stuck
    - label Cultural mechanisms — 50–80% MTTR cut
      children
        - label Funnel discipline
          desc Fixed RED → trace → profile order cuts the click count
        - label Signed error budget policy
          desc Gives the SLO teeth; freezes risky deploys
        - label Runbooks on every alert
          desc Recurring incident: 10 min, not 40–50 min
        - label Blameless postmortems
          desc Action-item flywheel prevents the next class
theme
  palette #f59e0b #14b8a6
